ices":{"1":{"Display":"Estremamente soddisfatto\/a"},"2":{"Display":"Moderatamente soddisfatto\/a"},"3":{"Display":"Leggermente soddisfatto\/a"},"4":{"Display":"N\u00e9 soddisfatto\/a n\u00e9 insoddisfatto\/a"},"5":{"Display":"Leggermente insoddisfatto\/a"},"6":{"Display":"Moderatamente insoddisfatto\/a"},"7":{"Display":"Estremamente insoddisfatto\/a"}},"QuestionText":"Quanto sei soddisfatto\/a o insoddisfatto\/a delle tue opportunit\u00e0 di avanzamento o di carriera?"},"JA":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u6e80\u8db3"},"2":{"Display":"\u307e\u3042\u307e\u3042\u6e80\u8db3"},"3":{"Display":"\u3084\u3084\u6e80\u8db3"},"4":{"Display":"\u3069\u3061\u3089\u3067\u3082\u306a\u3044"},"5":{"Display":"\u3084\u3084\u4e0d\u6e80"},"6":{"Display":"\u307e\u3042\u307e\u3042\u4e0d\u6e80"},"7":{"Display":"\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u4e0d\u6e80"}},"QuestionText":"\u6607\u9032\u3084\u30ad\u30e3\u30ea\u30a2\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u6a5f\u4f1a\u306b\u3069\u306e\u304f\u3089\u3044\u6e80\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f"},"KO":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\uadf9\ud788 \ub9cc\uc871\ud568"},"2":{"Display":"\uc5b4\ub290 \uc815\ub3c4 \ub9cc\uc871\ud568"},"3":{"Display":"\uc57d\uac04 \ub9cc\uc871\ud568"},"4":{"Display":"\ub9cc\uc871\ud558\uc9c0\ub3c4 \ubd88\ub9cc\uc871\ud558\uc9c0\ub3c4 \uc54a\uc74c"},"5":{"Display":"\uc57d\uac04 \ubd88\ub9cc\uc871\ud568"},"6":{"Display":"\uc5b4\ub290 \uc815\ub3c4 \ubd88\ub9cc\uc871\ud568"},"7":{"Display":"\uadf9\ud788 \ubd88\ub9cc\uc871\ud568"}},"QuestionText":"\uc2b9\uc9c4 \ub610\ub294 \uacbd\ub825 \uac1c\ubc1c\uc758 \uae30\ud68c\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uc5bc\ub9c8\ub098 \ub9cc\uc871 \ub610\ub294 \ubd88\ub9cc\uc871\ud558\uc2ed\ub2c8\uae4c?"},"NL":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Buitengewoon tevreden"},"2":{"Display":"Redelijk tevreden"},"3":{"Display":"Enigszins tevreden"},"4":{"Display":"Noch tevreden, noch ontevreden"},"5":{"Display":"Enigszins ontevreden"},"6":{"Display":"Redelijk ontevreden"},"7":{"Display":"Buitengewoon ontevreden"}},"QuestionText":"Hoe tevreden of ontevreden bent u over uw promotiekansen of loopbaanontwikkelingskansen?"},"PT":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Extremamente satisfeito"},"2":{"Display":"Relativamente satisfeito"},"3":{"Display":"Ligeiramente satisfeito"},"4":{"Display":"Nem satisfeito nem insatisfeito"},"5":{"Display":"Ligeiramente insatisfeito"},"6":{"Display":"Relativamente insatisfeito"},"7":{"Display":"Extremamente insatisfeito"}},"QuestionText":"At\u00e9 que ponto est\u00e1 satisfeito ou insatisfeito com as oportunidades de promo\u00e7\u00e3o ou progress\u00e3o de carreira?"},"PT-BR":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Extremamente satisfeito"},"2":{"Display":"Moderadamente satisfeito"},"3":{"Display":"Levemente satisfeito"},"4":{"Display":"Nem satisfeito nem insatisfeito"},"5":{"Display":"Levemente insatisfeito"},"6":{"Display":"Moderadamente insatisfeito"},"7":{"Display":"Extremamente insatisfeito"}},"QuestionText":"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 satisfeito ou insatisfeito com suas oportunidades de promo\u00e7\u00e3o ou progress\u00e3o de carreira?"},"ZH-S":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u6781\u5176\u6ee1\u610f"},"2":{"Display":"\u4e00\u822c\u6ee1\u610f"},"3":{"Display":"\u6709\u70b9\u6ee1\u610f"},"4":{"Display":"\u65e0\u6240\u8c13\u6ee1\u4e0d\u6ee1\u610f"},"5":{"Display":"\u6709\u70b9\u4e0d\u6ee1\u610f"},"6":{"Display":"\u4e00\u822c\u4e0d\u6ee1\u610f"},"7":{"Display":"\u6781\u4e0d\u6ee1\u610f"}},"QuestionText":"\u60a8\u5bf9\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u664b\u5347\u6216\u804c\u4e1a\u53d1\u5c55\u673a\u4f1a\u7684\u6ee1\u610f\u7a0b\u5ea6\u5982\u4f55\uff1f"},"ZH-T":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"\u6975\u5176\u6eff\u610f"},"2":{"Display":"\u4e2d\u5ea6\u6eff\u610f"},"3":{"Display":"\u7565\u5fae\u6eff\u610f"},"4":{"Display":"\u65e2\u4e0d\u662f\u6eff\u610f\u4e5f\u4e0d\u662f\u4e0d\u6eff\u610f"},"5":{"Display":"\u7565\u5fae\u4e0d\u6eff\u610f"},"6":{"Display":"\u4e2d\u5ea6\u4e0d\u6eff\u610f"},"7":{"Display":"\u6975\u4e0d\u6eff\u610f"}},"QuestionText":"\u60a8\u5c0d\u81ea\u5df1\u6649\u5347\u6216\u8077\u696d\u9032\u6b65\u7684\u6a5f\u6703\u6eff\u610f\u7a0b\u5ea6\u5982\u4f55\uff1f"}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":8,"QuestionDescription":"How satisfied or dissatisfied are you with your opportunities for career progression?","QuestionID":"QID127238937","QuestionText":"How satisfied&nbsp;or dissatisfied&nbsp;are you with your opportunities for career progression?","QuestionText_Unsafe":"How satisfied&nbsp;or dissatisfied&nbsp;are you with your opportunities for promotion or career progression?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cYis11Ag8c0U8js","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID180","SecondaryAttribute":"Thanks for using a Qualtrics Survey Template! To get started, follow the instructions below. When...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Instruction","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":{"DE":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Vielen Dank, dass Sie eine Qualtrics-Umfragenvorlage verwendet haben! Befolgen Sie zun\u00e4chst die nachstehenden Anweisungen. Wenn Sie bereit sind, l\u00f6schen Sie diese Frage, damit Ihre Befragten sie nicht sehen!&nbsp;<\/strong><div><b><br><\/b><div>1. Lesen Sie diese Umfrage durch und achten Sie darauf, den Text zu aktualisieren oder gegebenenfalls zu ersetzen. (Sie k\u00f6nnen auch alle Fragen entfernen, die Sie nicht ben\u00f6tigen. Klicken Sie einfach auf die Frage und dann auf die kleine rote Minus-Schaltfl\u00e4che rechts neben der Frage, um sie in den Papierkorb zu verschieben.)&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Klicken Sie oben rechts auf der Editor-Seite auf die Schaltfl\u00e4che \u201eVorschau\u201c, um zu sehen, was Ihre Befragten sehen, wenn sie an Ihrer Umfrage teilnehmen.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Wenn Ihre Umfrage fertig ist, rufen Sie oben den Reiter \u201eVerteilungen\u201c auf, um zu sehen, wie Sie Ihre Umfrage an die Teilnehmer senden k\u00f6nnen.&nbsp;<\/div><div><strong><br><\/strong><\/div><div><strong>Denken Sie daran, diese Frage zu l\u00f6schen. Viel Spa\u00df mit der Umfrage!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>"},"EN-GB":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Thanks for using a Qualtrics Survey Template! To get started, follow the instructions below. When you're ready to go, make sure to delete this question so that your respondents don't see it!<\/span><br><br>1. Read through this survey and make sure to update or replace text when applicable. (You can also remove any questions that you don't need - just click on the question, then click on the little red minus button to the left of the question to put it into the trash.)<br><br><div>2. Click the \"Preview\" button at the top right of the editor page to take a look at what your respondents will see when they take your survey.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. When your survey is ready, go to the \"Distributions\" tab above to see how you can send your survey to your respondents.<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Remember to delete this question, and happy surveying!<\/span><\/div>"},"ES":{"QuestionText":"<strong>\u00a1Gracias por utilizar una plantilla de encuesta de Qualtrics! Para comenzar, siga las instrucciones a continuaci\u00f3n. Cuando est\u00e9 listo, aseg\u00farese de eliminar esta pregunta para que sus encuestados no la vean.&nbsp;<\/strong><div><b><br><\/b><div>1. Lea esta encuesta y recuerde actualizar o reemplazar el texto seg\u00fan corresponda. (Tambi\u00e9n puede eliminar cualquier pregunta que no necesite. Para ello, simplemente haga clic en la pregunta y, luego, haga clic en el bot\u00f3n rojo peque\u00f1o con el signo menos a la derecha de la pregunta para enviarla a la papelera).&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Haga clic en el bot\u00f3n \"Vista previa\" en la parte superior derecha de la p\u00e1gina del editor para visualizar lo que ver\u00e1n sus encuestados cuando respondan la encuesta.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Cuando su encuesta est\u00e9 lista, vaya arriba a la pesta\u00f1a \"Distribuciones\" para ver c\u00f3mo enviar su encuesta a los encuestados.&nbsp;<\/div><div><strong><br><\/strong><\/div><div><strong>Recuerde eliminar esta pregunta. \u00a1Que su encuesta salga excelente!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>"},"ES-ES":{"QuestionText":"<b>\u00a1Gracias por usar una plantilla de encuesta de Qualtrics! Para empezar, siga las instrucciones que encontrar\u00e1 a continuaci\u00f3n. Cuando lo haya hecho, aseg\u00farese de borrar esta pregunta para que no la vean los encuestados.&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1. Lea esta encuesta y aseg\u00farese de actualizar o sustituir el texto si es necesario. Tambi\u00e9n puede borrar cualquier pregunta innecesaria; solo tiene que hacer clic en la pregunta y, a continuaci\u00f3n, hacer clic en el bot\u00f3n del peque\u00f1o s\u00edmbolo menos rojo a la derecha de la pregunta para enviarlo a la papelera.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Haga clic en el bot\u00f3n 'Vista previa' en la esquina superior derecha de la p\u00e1gina del editor para echar un vistazo a lo que ver\u00e1n los encuestados cuando realicen la encuesta.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Cuando la encuesta est\u00e9 lista, vaya a la pesta\u00f1a 'Distribuciones' de arriba para ver c\u00f3mo enviar la encuesta a los encuestados.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>Recuerde borrar esta pregunta y \u00a1feliz encuesta!<\/b><\/div>"},"FI":{"QuestionText":"<b>Kiitos Qualtrics Survey Templaten k\u00e4yt\u00f6st\u00e4! Aloita noudattamalla alla olevia ohjeita. Kun olet valmis, muista poistaa t\u00e4m\u00e4 kysymys, jotta vastaajat eiv\u00e4t n\u00e4e sit\u00e4!&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><div>1. Lue t\u00e4m\u00e4 kysely l\u00e4pi ja muista p\u00e4ivitt\u00e4\u00e4 tai korvata teksti tarvittaessa. (Voit my\u00f6s poistaa kaikki tarpeettomat kysymykset - napsauta vain kysymyst\u00e4 ja napsauta sitten kysymyksen oikealla puolella olevaa pient\u00e4 punaista miinuspainiketta asettaaksesi sen roskakoriin.)&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Napsauta Esikatselu-painiketta editointisivun oikeassa yl\u00e4kulmassa ja katso, mit\u00e4 vastaajat n\u00e4kev\u00e4t ottaessaan osaa kyselyyn.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Kun kyselysi on valmis, siirry yll\u00e4 olevaan Jakelu-v\u00e4lilehteen n\u00e4hd\u00e4ksesi, kuinka voit l\u00e4hett\u00e4\u00e4 kyselyn vastaajillesi.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>Muista poistaa t\u00e4m\u00e4 kysymys, ja hyv\u00e4\u00e4 tutkimusta!<\/b><\/div><\/div>"},"FR":{"QuestionText":"<b>Merci d'avoir utilis\u00e9 un mod\u00e8le d'enqu\u00eate Qualtrics! Pour commencer, suivez les instructions ci-dessous. Lorsque vous \u00eates pr\u00eat \u00e0 commencer, assurez-vous de supprimer cette question afin que vos r\u00e9pondants ne la voient pas!&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1. Lisez cette enqu\u00eate et assurez-vous de mettre \u00e0 jour ou de remplacer le texte, le cas \u00e9ch\u00e9ant. (Vous pouvez \u00e9galement supprimer toutes les questions dont vous n'avez pas besoin - cliquez simplement sur la question, puis cliquez sur le petit bouton moins rouge \u00e0 droite de la question pour le mettre \u00e0 la poubelle.)&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Cliquez sur le bouton \u00ab&nbsp;Aper\u00e7u&nbsp;\u00bb en haut \u00e0 droite de la page de l'\u00e9diteur pour voir ce que vos r\u00e9pondants verront lorsqu'ils r\u00e9pondront \u00e0 votre enqu\u00eate.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Lorsque votre enqu\u00eate est pr\u00eate, acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 l'onglet \u00ab&nbsp;Distributions&nbsp;\u00bb ci-dessus pour voir comment envoyer votre enqu\u00eate \u00e0 vos r\u00e9pondants.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>N'oubliez pas de supprimer cette question et bonne enqu\u00eate!<\/b><\/div>"},"IT":{"QuestionText":"<b>Grazie per aver utilizzato un modello di sondaggio Qualtrics! Per iniziare, segui le istruzioni riportate qui sotto. Quando sei pronto, assicurati di eliminare questa domanda in modo che gli intervistati non la vedano!&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1. Leggi questo sondaggio e assicurati di aggiornare o sostituire il testo quando \u00e8 necessario. (Puoi anche rimuovere tutte le domande che non ti servono: fai clic sulla domanda, quindi fai clic sul piccolo pulsante rosso con il meno sulla destra della domanda per metterla nel cestino.)&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Fai clic sul pulsante \"Anteprima\" in alto a destra nella pagina dell'editor per guardare ci\u00f2 che vedranno i tuoi intervistati quando parteciperanno al sondaggio.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Quando il sondaggio \u00e8 pronto, vai alla scheda \"Distribuzioni\" in alto per vedere come puoi inviare il sondaggio ai tuoi intervistati.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>Ricorda di eliminare questa domanda e buon sondaggio!<\/b><\/div>"},"JA":{"QuestionText":"<b>\u30af\u30a2\u30eb\u30c8\u30ea\u30af\u30b9\u30a2\u30f3\u30b1\u30fc\u30c8\u30c6\u30f3\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u3054\u5229\u7528\u3044\u305f\u3060\u304d\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u958b\u59cb\u3059\u308b\u306b\u306f\u3001\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u624b\u9806\u306b\u5f93\u3063\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u6e96\u5099\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3089\u3001\u3053\u306e\u8cea\u554f\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3057\u3066\u3001\u56de\u7b54\u8005\u306b\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1. \u3053\u306e\u30a2\u30f3\u30b1\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u3001\u5fc5\u8981\u306b\u5fdc\u3058\u3066\u30c6\u30ad\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u66f4\u65b0\u307e\u305f\u306f\u7f6e\u304d\u63db\u3048\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\uff08\u4e0d\u8981\u306a\u8cea\u554f\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u8cea\u554f\u3092\u30af\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u3057\u3001\u8cea\u554f\u306e\u53f3\u5074\u306b\u3042\u308b\u5c0f\u3055\u306a\u8d64\u3044\u30de\u30a4\u30ca\u30b9\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3092\u30af\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u3057\u3066\u30b4\u30df\u7bb1\u306b\u5165\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\uff09&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>2. \u30a8\u30c7\u30a3\u30bf\u30fc\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u53f3\u4e0a\u306b\u3042\u308b [\u30d7\u30ec\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc]\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3092\u30af\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u3057\u3001\u56de\u7b54\u8005\u304c\u30a2\u30f3\u30b1\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u56de\u7b54\u3057\u305f\u3068\u304d\u306b\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u308b\u5185\u5bb9\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>3. \u30a2\u30f3\u30b1\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u6e96\u5099\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3089\u3001\u4e0a\u306e[\u914d\u4fe1]\u30bf\u30d6\u306b\u79fb\u52d5\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30a2\u30f3\u30b1\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u56de\u7b54\u8005\u306b\u9001\u4fe1\u3059\u308b\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002<div><br><\/div><div><b>\u6700\u5f8c\u306b\u3001\u3053\u306e\u8cea\u554f\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u305a\u306b\u524a\u9664\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002<\/b><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>"},"KO":{"QuestionText":"<b>Qualtrics Survey Template\uc744 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud574 \uc8fc\uc154\uc11c \uac10\uc0ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\ub824\uba74 \uc544\ub798 \uc9c0\uce68\uc744 \ub530\ub974\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624. \uc900\ube44\uac00 \ub418\uc5c8\uc73c\uba74 \uc751\ub2f5\uc790\uac00 \uc774\ub97c \ubcfc \uc218 \uc5c6\ub3c4\ub85d \uc774 \uc9c8\ubb38\uc744 \uc0ad\uc81c\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624.&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1.\uc774 \uc124\ubb38 \uc870\uc0ac\ub97c \uc77d\uace0 \ud574\ub2f9\ub418\ub294 \uacbd\uc6b0 \ud14d\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub97c \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\ud558\uac70\ub098 \uad50\uccb4\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624. (\ud544\uc694\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc740 \uc9c8\ubb38\ub3c4 \uc81c\uac70\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc9c8\ubb38\uc744 \ud074\ub9ad \ud55c \ub2e4\uc74c \uc9c8\ubb38 \uc624\ub978\ucabd\uc758 \uc791\uc740 \ube68\uac04\uc0c9 \ube7c\uae30 \ubc84\ud2bc\uc744 \ud074\ub9ad\ud558\uc5ec \ud734\uc9c0\ud1b5\uc5d0 \ub123\uc73c\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624.)&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. '\ubbf8\ub9ac\ubcf4\uae30'\ubc84\ud2bc\uc744 \ud074\ub9ad\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624. \ud3b8\uc9d1\uc790 \ud398\uc774\uc9c0 \uc624\ub978\ucabd \uc0c1\ub2e8\uc5d0\uc11c \uc124\ubb38 \uc870\uc0ac\uc5d0 \uc751\ud55c \uc751\ub2f5\uc790\uac00 \ubcfc \uc218\uc788\ub294 \ub0b4\uc6a9\uc744 \uc0b4\ud3b4 \ubd05\ub2c8\ub2e4.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. \uc124\ubb38 \uc870\uc0ac\uac00 \uc900\ube44\ub418\uba74 \uc704\uc758 '\ubc30\ud3ec'\ud0ed\uc73c\ub85c \uc774\ub3d9\ud558\uc5ec \uc124\ubb38 \uc870\uc0ac\ub97c \uc751\ub2f5\uc790\uc5d0\uac8c \ubcf4\ub0b4\ub294 \ubc29\ubc95\uc744 \ud655\uc778\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>\uc774 \uc9c8\ubb38\uc744 \uc0ad\uc81c\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624. \uadf8\ub9ac\uace0 \ud589\ubcf5\ud55c \uc124\ubb38\uc870\uc0ac\uac00 \ub418\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624!<\/b><\/div>"},"NL":{"QuestionText":"<b>Bedankt voor het gebruiken van een Qualtrics-enqu\u00eatesjabloon. Volg de onderstaande instructies om aan de slag te gaan. Als u klaar bent om te gaan, vergeet dan niet om deze vraag te verwijderen zodat uw respondenten hem niet zien.&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1. Lees deze enqu\u00eate door en bewerk of vervang tekst indien van toepassing. (U kunt ook alle vragen verwijderen die u niet nodig hebt: klik gewoon op de vraag en klik vervolgens rechts op de kleine rode minknop om de vraag naar de prullenbak te verplaatsen.)&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Klik op de knop 'Voorbeeld' in de rechterbovenhoek van de editorpagina om te zien wat uw respondenten zullen zien wanneer ze uw enqu\u00eate invullen.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Als uw enqu\u00eate gereed is, gaat u naar het tabblad 'Distributie' hierboven om te zien hoe u uw enqu\u00eate naar uw respondenten kunt sturen.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>Vergeet niet deze vraag te verwijderen en veel plezier met onderzoeken!<\/b><\/div>"},"PT":{"QuestionText":"<b>Obrigado por usar um modelo de inqu\u00e9rito da Qualtrics! Para come\u00e7ar, siga as instru\u00e7\u00f5es abaixo. Quando estiver pronto, exclua esta pergunta para que os seus inquiridos n\u00e3o a vejam!&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1. Leia este inqu\u00e9rito e atualize ou substitua o texto, quando aplic\u00e1vel. (Tamb\u00e9m pode retirar todas as perguntas que n\u00e3o precisar - basta clicar na pergunta e, depois, clicar no pequeno bot\u00e3o de menos vermelho, \u00e0 direita da pergunta, para a colocar no lixo.)&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2. Clique no bot\u00e3o \"Pr\u00e9-visualizar\" no canto superior direito da p\u00e1gina do editor para ver o que os seus inquiridos ver\u00e3o quando responderem ao seu inqu\u00e9rito.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. Quando o seu inqu\u00e9rito estiver pronto, v\u00e1 ao separador \"Distribui\u00e7\u00f5es\" acima para ver como pode enviar o seu inqu\u00e9rito aos seus inquiridos.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>Lembre-se de excluir esta pergunta e bom inqu\u00e9rito!<\/b><\/div>"},"PT-BR":{"QuestionText":"<b>Obrigado por usar um modelo de pesquisa da Qualtrics! Para come\u00e7ar, siga as instru\u00e7\u00f5es abaixo. Quando estiver pronto, exclua esta pergunta para que seus respondentes n\u00e3o a vejam!&nbsp;<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1. Leia esta pesquisa e atualize ou substitua o texto, quando aplic\u00e1vel. (Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m pode remover todas as perguntas de que n\u00e3o precisa - basta clicar na pergunta e no pequeno bot\u00e3o de menos vermelho \u00e0 direita da pergunta para coloc\u00e1-la na lixeira.)&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>2. Clique no bot\u00e3o \"Visualizar\" no canto superior direito da p\u00e1gina do editor para ver o que seus entrevistados ver\u00e3o quando responderem \u00e0 sua pesquisa.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>3. Quando sua pesquisa estiver pronta, v\u00e1 para a guia \"Distribui\u00e7\u00f5es\" acima para ver como voc\u00ea pode enviar sua pesquisa para seus respondentes.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div><b>Lembre-se de excluir esta pergunta e divirta-se com a pesquisa!<\/b><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>"},"ZH-S":{"QuestionText":"<b>\u611f\u8c22\u60a8\u4f7f\u7528Qualtrics\u8c03\u67e5\u6a21\u677f\uff01\u8bf7\u6309\u7167\u4ee5\u4e0b\u8bf4\u660e\u8fdb\u884c\u64cd\u4f5c\uff0c\u5f00\u59cb\u8bbe\u7f6e\u3002\u5f53\u60a8\u51c6\u5907\u597d\u5f00\u59cb\u65f6\uff0c\u8bf7\u786e\u4fdd\u5220\u9664\u6b64\u95ee\u9898\uff0c\u4ee5\u786e\u4fdd\u60a8\u7684\u8c03\u67e5\u5bf9\u8c61\u4e0d\u4f1a\u770b\u5230\u6b64\u95ee\u9898\uff01<\/b>&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>1.\u901a\u8bfb\u6b64\u8c03\u67e5\uff0c\u5e76\u786e\u4fdd\u5728\u9002\u7528\u65f6\u66f4\u65b0\u6216\u66ff\u6362\u6587\u672c\u3002 \uff08\u60a8\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u5220\u9664\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u7684\u4efb\u4f55\u95ee\u9898-\u53ea\u9700\u5355\u51fb\u95ee\u9898\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u5355\u51fb\u95ee\u9898\u53f3\u4fa7\u7684\u7ea2\u8272\u5c0f\u51cf\u53f7\u6309\u94ae\u5c06\u5176\u653e\u5165\u5783\u573e\u6876\u3002\uff09<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2.\u5355\u51fb\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u9875\u9762\u7684\u53f3\u4e0a\u89d2\u201c\u9884\u89c8\u201d\u6309\u94ae\uff0c\u67e5\u770b\u8c03\u67e5\u5bf9\u8c61\u5728\u8fdb\u884c\u8c03\u67e5\u65f6\u4f1a\u770b\u5230\u54ea\u4e9b\u5185\u5bb9\u3002&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3.\u51c6\u5907\u597d\u8c03\u67e5\u540e\uff0c\u8bf7\u524d\u5f80\u4e0a\u65b9\u7684\u201c\u5206\u5e03\u201d\u9009\u9879\u5361\uff0c\u67e5\u770b\u5982\u4f55\u5c06\u8c03\u67e5\u53d1\u9001\u7ed9\u8c03\u67e5\u5bf9\u8c61\u3002<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>\u5207\u8bb0\u5220\u9664\u6b64\u95ee\u9898\uff0c\u5e76\u795d\u60a8\u8c03\u67e5\u6109\u5feb\uff01<\/b><\/div>"},"ZH-T":{"QuestionText":"<b>\u611f\u8b1d\u60a8\u4f7f\u7528 Qualtrics \u8abf\u67e5\u7bc4\u672c\uff01\u8981\u958b\u59cb\u4f7f\u7528\uff0c\u8acb\u6309\u7167\u4ee5\u4e0b\u8aaa\u660e\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002\u7576\u60a8\u6e96\u5099\u597d\u4e86\uff0c\u8acb\u78ba\u4fdd\u522a\u9664\u6b64\u554f\u984c\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u60a8\u7684\u53d7\u8a2a\u8005\u770b\u4e0d\u5230\u5b83\uff01<\/b><div><br><\/div><div>1.\u95b1\u8b80\u672c\u8abf\u67e5\uff0c\u4e26\u78ba\u4fdd\u5728\u9069\u7528\u7684\u60c5\u6cc1\u4e0b\u66f4\u65b0\u6216\u66ff\u63db\u6587\u672c\u3002\uff08\u60a8\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u522a\u9664\u60a8\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u7684\u4efb\u4f55\u554f\u984c-\u53ea\u9700\u6309\u4e00\u4e0b\u554f\u984c\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u6309\u4e00\u4e0b\u554f\u984c\u53f3\u5074\u7684\u5c0f\u7d05\u8272\u6e1b\u865f\u6309\u9215\uff0c\u5c07\u5176\u653e\u5165\u5783\u573e\u6876\u3002\uff09<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>2.\u6309\u4e00\u4e0b\u7de8\u8f2f\u5668\u9801\u9762\u53f3\u4e0a\u89d2\u7684\u300c\u9810\u89bd\u300d\u6309\u9215\uff0c\u67e5\u770b\u53d7\u8a2a\u8005\u5728\u9032\u884c\u8abf\u67e5\u6642\u5c07\u770b\u5230\u7684\u5167\u5bb9\u3002<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3.\u8abf\u67e5\u6e96\u5099\u5c31\u7dd2\u5f8c\uff0c\u8f49\u5230\u4e0a\u9762\u7684\u300c\u5206\u914d\u300d\u6a19\u7c64\uff0c\u77ad\u89e3\u5982\u4f55\u5c07\u8abf\u67e5\u767c\u9001\u7d66\u53d7\u8a2a\u8005\u3002<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>\u8a18\u5f97\u522a\u9664\u9019\u500b\u554f\u984c\uff0c\u795d\u60a8\u8abf\u67e5\u6109\u5feb\uff01<\/b><\/div>"}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Thanks for using a Qualtrics Survey Template! To get started, follow the instructions below. When...","QuestionID":"QID180","QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Thanks for using a Qualtrics Survey Template! To get started, follow the instructions below. When you're ready to go, make sure to delete this question so that your respondents don't see it!<\/span><br><br>1. Read through this survey and make sure to update or replace text when applicable. (You can also remove any questions that you don't need - just click on the question, then click on the little red minus button to the left of the question to put it into the trash.)<br><br><div>2. Click the \"Preview\" button at the top right of the editor page to take a look at what your respondents will see when they take your survey.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>3. When your survey is ready, go to the \"Distributions\" tab above to see how you can send your survey to your respondents.<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Remember to delete this question, and happy surveying!<\/span><\/div>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cYis11Ag8c0U8js","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID181","SecondaryAttribute":"The purpose of this survey is to collect feedback on your satisfaction as an employee.\u00a0 \u00a0 It will.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q1","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":{"DE":{"QuestionText":"Der Zweck dieser Umfrage besteht darin, Feedback zu Ihrer Zufriedenheit als Mitarbeiter zu sammeln.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Sie nimmt nur 3 bis 4 Minuten in Anspruch. Ihr Feedback ist anonym und wird nur dazu verwendet, Ihre Erfahrung als Mitarbeiter zu verbessern.<\/div>"},"EN-GB":{"QuestionText":"The purpose of this survey is to collect feedback on your satisfaction as an employee.&nbsp;<div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>It will take only 3 to 4 minutes. Your feedback will be used to help us improve employee experiences.&nbsp;<\/div>"},"ES":{"QuestionText":"La finalidad de esta encuesta es recopilar opiniones sobre su satisfacci\u00f3n como empleado.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Tardar\u00e1 apenas 3-4&nbsp;minutos en completarla. Su opini\u00f3n es an\u00f3nima y se utilizar\u00e1 solo para ayudarnos a mejorar su experiencia como empleado.<\/div>"},"ES-ES":{"QuestionText":"El prop\u00f3sito de esta encuesta es recopilar comentarios sobre su satisfacci\u00f3n como empleado.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Solo tardar\u00e1 unos 3 o 4&nbsp;minutos. Las opiniones son an\u00f3nimas y las utilizaremos \u00fanicamente para poder mejorar su experiencia como empleado.<\/div>"},"FI":{"QuestionText":"T\u00e4m\u00e4n kyselyn tarkoituksena on ker\u00e4t\u00e4 palautetta tyytyv\u00e4isyydest\u00e4si ty\u00f6ntekij\u00e4n\u00e4.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Se vie vain 3-4 minuuttia. Palautteesi on anonyymi\u00e4, ja sit\u00e4 k\u00e4ytet\u00e4\u00e4n vain auttamaan meit\u00e4 parantamaan ty\u00f6ntekij\u00e4n kokemustasi.<\/div>"},"FR":{"QuestionText":"Le but de cette enqu\u00eate est de recueillir des commentaires sur votre satisfaction en tant qu'employ\u00e9.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Cela ne vous prendra que 3 \u00e0 4 minutes. Vos commentaires sont anonymes et ne seront utilis\u00e9s que pour nous aider \u00e0 am\u00e9liorer votre exp\u00e9rience en tant qu'employ\u00e9.<\/div>"},"IT":{"QuestionText":"Lo scopo di questo sondaggio \u00e8 raccogliere un feedback sulla tua soddisfazione come dipendente.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Ci vorranno solo 3-4 minuti. Il tuo feedback \u00e8 anonimo e verr\u00e0 utilizzato solo per aiutarci a migliorare la tua esperienza come dipendente.<\/div>"},"JA":{"QuestionText":"\u3053\u306e\u8abf\u67fb\u306e\u76ee\u7684\u306f\u3001\u5f93\u696d\u54e1\u306e\u6e80\u8db3\u5ea6\u3092\u53ce\u96c6\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002<div><br><\/div><div>\u6240\u8981\u6642\u9593\u306f3\u301c4\u5206\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u306f\u533f\u540d\u3067\u53ce\u96c6\u3055\u308c\u3001\u5f93\u696d\u54e1\u306e\u4f53\u9a13\u3092\u5411\u4e0a\u3055\u305b\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u306e\u307f\u4f7f\u7528\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/div>"},"KO":{"QuestionText":"\uc774 \uc124\ubb38 \uc870\uc0ac\uc758 \ubaa9\uc801\uc740 \uc9c1\uc6d0\uc73c\ub85c\uc11c\uc758 \ub9cc\uc871\ub3c4\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ud53c\ub4dc\ubc31\uc744 \uc218\uc9d1\ud558\ub294 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>3 ~ 4 \ubd84 \ubc16\uc5d0 \uac78\ub9ac\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadc0\ud558\uc758 \uc758\uacac\uc740 \uc775\uba85\uc774\uba70 \uc9c1\uc6d0\uc73c\ub85c\uc11c\uc758 \uacbd\ud5d8\uc744 \ud5a5\uc0c1\uc2dc\ud0a4\ub294 \ub370 \ub3c4\uc6c0\uc774 \ub420 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.<\/div>"},"NL":{"QuestionText":"Het doel van deze enqu\u00eate is het verzamelen van feedback over uw tevredenheid als werknemer.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Het invullen kost slechts 3-4 minuten. Uw feedback is anoniem en wordt alleen gebruikt om ons te helpen uw ervaring als werknemer te verbeteren.<\/div>"},"PT":{"QuestionText":"O objetivo deste inqu\u00e9rito \u00e9 recolher feedback sobre a sua satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o como funcion\u00e1rio.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Demorar\u00e1 apenas 3 a 4 minutos. O seu feedback \u00e9 an\u00f3nimo e ser\u00e1 usado apenas para nos ajudar a melhorar a sua experi\u00eancia como funcion\u00e1rio.<\/div>"},"PT-BR":{"QuestionText":"O objetivo desta pesquisa \u00e9 coletar feedback sobre sua satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o como funcion\u00e1rio.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Levar\u00e1 apenas 3 a 4 minutos. Seus coment\u00e1rios s\u00e3o an\u00f4nimos e ser\u00e3o usados apenas para nos ajudar a melhorar sua experi\u00eancia como funcion\u00e1rio.<\/div>"},"ZH-S":{"QuestionText":"\u8fd9\u9879\u8c03\u67e5\u7684\u76ee\u7684\u662f\u6536\u96c6\u53cd\u9988\u610f\u89c1\uff0c\u4e86\u89e3\u60a8\u4f5c\u4e3a\u5458\u5de5\u7684\u6ee1\u610f\u5ea6\u3002<div><br><\/div><div>\u8fd9\u4ec5\u9700 3 \u81f3 4 \u5206\u949f\u3002\u60a8\u7684\u53cd\u9988\u662f\u533f\u540d\u7684\uff0c\u4ec5\u7528\u4e8e\u5e2e\u52a9\u6211\u4eec\u6539\u5584\u60a8\u7684\u5458\u5de5\u4f53\u9a8c\u3002<\/div>"},"ZH-T":{"QuestionText":"\u6b64\u8abf\u67e5\u7684\u76ee\u7684\u662f\u6536\u96c6\u60a8\u7684\u54e1\u5de5\u6eff\u610f\u5ea6\u610f\u898b\u53cd\u994b\u3002<div><br><\/div><div>\u8abf\u67e5\u53ea\u6703\u6301\u7e8c 3 \u81f3 4 \u5206\u9418\u3002\u60a8\u7684\u610f\u898b\u53cd\u994b\u662f\u533f\u540d\u7684\uff0c\u53ea\u6703\u7528\u65bc\u5354\u52a9\u6211\u5011\u6539\u9032\u60a8\u4f5c\u70ba\u54e1\u5de5\u7684\u9ad4\u9a57\u3002<\/div>"}},"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"The 